{"id": "66ad5d3a-ef9b-4b73-86e9-d7266ef5906c", "slug": "cognitive-data-synthesis", "title": "Cognitive Data Synthesis", "description": "Cognitive Data Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Cognitive Data Synthesis\"\ndescription: \"Cognitive Data Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#8A4A99\"\n  secondary: \"#080510\"\n  accent: \"#D18BAA\"\n  background: \"#F5F5F7\"\n  surface: \"#D18BAA\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Cognitive Data Synthesis\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 76; favorites: 4; remixes: 1.\nTags: feature, section, animated, cta, bento.\n## Overview\nCognitive Data Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nLUMENOS // CORE METHODOLOGY We push the boundaries of neural synthesis through a cognitive lattice designed to structure and harmonize datasets in their most fluid forms. We harness the intersection of dynamic nodes and…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: COGNITIVE DATA SYNTHESIS ENGINE.; WHERE CHAOS BECOMES STRUCTURE..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #8A4A99, secondary #080510, accent #D18BAA, background #F5F5F7, surface #D18BAA, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Cognitive Data Synthesis</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#f5f5f7] min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-12 font-sans antialiased text-white selection:bg-white/20 selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- Main Container simulating the presentation view -->\n    <main class=\"w-full max-w-[1500px] grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-[2px] bg-white border-[8px] md:border-[16px] border-white shadow-2xl\">\n\n        <!-- Panel 1: How We Work -->\n        <section class=\"bg-[#080510] relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col h-[600px] md:h-[800px]\">\n            <div class=\"p-8 md:p-12 z-10 flex flex-col h-full\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs tracking-widest text-gray-400 uppercase mb-12 font-medium\">\n                    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gray-400\"></span>\n                    <span>LUMENOS // CORE METHODOLOGY</span>\n                </div>\n                \n                <p class=\"gsap-reveal text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-gray-200 mb-6 font-medium\">\n                    We push the boundaries of neural synthesis through a cognitive lattice designed to structure and harmonize datasets in their most fluid forms.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"gsap-reveal text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-[#8a5a7a]\">\n                    We harness the intersection of dynamic nodes and semantic currents, routing them into an optimized execution core where every digital fluctuation finds absolute clarity.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Visual: Planet Curve -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-1/2 overflow-hidden flex justify-center items-end pb-24 md:pb-32 pointer-events-none\">\n                <!-- Glowing Sphere Edge -->\n                <div class=\"absolute w-[200%] h-[200%] bottom-[-150%] rounded-[50%] border-t border-[#8a4a99]/30 shadow-[0_-30px_80px_rgba(45,21,66,0.4)]\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(ellipse at top, #261542 0%, #080510 60%);\"></div>\n                \n                <!-- Glowing Dots Arch -->\n                <div class=\"relative w-48 h-12 flex justify-between items-end z-20\">\n                    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(255,255,255,0.9)] animate-pulse mb-0\" style=\"animation-duration: 2s;\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(255,255,255,0.9)] animate-pulse mb-6\" style=\"animation-duration: 2s; animation-delay: 0.4s;\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(255,255,255,0.9)] animate-pulse mb-6\" style=\"animation-duration: 2s; animation-delay: 0.8s;\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(255,255,255,0.9)] animate-pulse mb-0\" style=\"animation-duration: 2s; animation-delay: 1.2s;\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Panel 2: Centerpiece with WebGL -->\n        <section class=\"bg-[#080510] relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center h-[600px] md:h-[800px]\">\n            <div class=\"pt-16 pb-8 z-10 flex flex-col items-center px-8 text-center\">\n                <!-- Abstract Logo Shape -->\n                <div class=\"relative w-10 h-10 mb-16 opacity-90\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 border-[1.5px] border-white rounded-full\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 border-[1.5px] border-white rounded-[40%] transform rotate-[60deg]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 border-[1.5px] border-white rounded-[40%] transform -rotate-[60deg]\"></div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <h1 class=\"gsap-reveal text-2xl md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-tight leading-tight text-white/95\">\n                    COGNITIVE DATA<br>SYNTHESIS ENGINE.\n                </h1>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- WebGL Container -->\n            <div id=\"webgl-container\" class=\"absolute inset-0 top-[20%] z-0 pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-16 z-20\">\n                <button class=\"px-8 py-3.5 text-xs tracking-[0.2em] font-medium text-white border border-white/20 rounded-full hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-all duration-500 ease-out focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white/50 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                    INITIALIZE\n                </button>\n            </div>\n            \n            <!-- Bottom fade gradient to ground the wireframe -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 w-full h-1/3 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#080510] to-transparent z-10 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Panel 3: Data Vortex -->\n        <section class=\"bg-[#080510] relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col items-center justify-center h-[600px] md:h-[800px]\">\n            \n            <!-- SVG Text Vortex Animation -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center opacity-60 mix-blend-screen pointer-events-none z-0\">\n                <!-- Outer Track -->\n                <svg class=\"absolute w-[150%] max-w-[800px] aspect-square animate-[spin_60s_linear_infinite]\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 500\">\n                    <path id=\"track1\" d=\"M 250, 250 m -220, 0 a 220,220 0 1,1 440,0 a 220,220 0 1,1 -440,0\" fill=\"transparent\" />\n                    <text class=\"text-xs fill-[#8a4a99] opacity-40 font-mono tracking-widest uppercase\">\n                        <textPath href=\"#track1\" startOffset=\"0%\">4E 45 55 52 41 4C 20 4E 45 54 57 4F 52 4B 20 4F 4E 4C 49 4E 45</textPath>\n                    </text>\n                </svg>\n                <!-- Middle Track -->\n                <svg class=\"absolute w-[120%] max-w-[600px] aspect-square animate-[spin_40s_linear_infinite_reverse]\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 500\">\n                    <path id=\"track2\" d=\"M 250, 250 m -160, 0 a 160,160 0 1,1 320,0 a 160,160 0 1,1 -320,0\" fill=\"transparent\" />\n                    <text class=\"text-xs fill-white opacity-60 font-mono tracking-[0.3em] uppercase\">\n                        <textPath href=\"#track2\" startOffset=\"50%\">WHERE CHAOS BECOMES STRUCTURE // NEURAL PATHWAYS // ORCHESTRATING STREAMS //</textPath>\n                    </text>\n                </svg>\n                <!-- Inner Track -->\n                <svg class=\"absolute w-[90%] max-w-[450px] aspect-square animate-[spin_30s_linear_infinite]\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 500\">\n                    <path id=\"track3\" d=\"M 250, 250 m -100, 0 a 100,100 0 1,1 200,0 a 100,100 0 1,1 -200,0\" fill=\"transparent\" />\n                    <text class=\"text-xs fill-[#d18baa] opacity-80 font-mono tracking-widest uppercase\">\n                        <textPath href=\"#track3\" startOffset=\"25%\">SYNTHESIS.NUCLEUS.ONLINE // FLUID.LOGIC.LOCKED</textPath>\n                    </text>\n                </svg>\n                \n                <!-- Dashed Abstract Rings -->\n                <div class=\"absolute w-[60%] aspect-square rounded-full border-[0.5px] border-dashed border-[#8a4a99]/30 animate-[spin_20s_linear_infinite]\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute w-[40%] aspect-square rounded-full border-[0.5px] border-dashed border-white/20 animate-[spin_15s_linear_infinite_reverse]\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Vortex Mask Gradient -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(8,5,16,0.4) 20%, #080510 65%);\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Content Overlay -->\n            <div class=\"relative z-20 flex flex-col items-center text-center px-10 max-w-sm mt-8\">\n                <h2 class=\"gsap-reveal text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] font-medium text-white mb-5\">WHERE CHAOS BECOMES STRUCTURE.</h2>\n                <p class=\"gsap-reveal text-xs text-[#9e7a8b] leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n                    Using an adaptive framework rooted in cognitive principles and fractal geometry, we convert massive arrays of fragmented inputs into hyper-efficient neural architectures.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-16 z-20\">\n                <p class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-[#7e4a7e] uppercase font-medium\">SEAMLESS. ELEGANT. UNIFIED.</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            // WebGL Animation Initialization\n            const container = document.getElementById('webgl-container');\n            if (container && typeof THREE !== 'undefined') {\n                const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n                \n                const aspect = container.clientWidth / container.clientHeight;\n                const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, aspect, 0.1, 1000);\n                \n                const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n                renderer.setSize(container.clientWidth, container.clientHeight);\n                renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n                container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n                const segments = 50;\n                const size = 30;\n                const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(size, size, segments, segments);\n                const pos = geometry.attributes.position;\n                \n                for(let i = 0; i < pos.count; i++) {\n                    const x = pos.getX(i);\n                    const y = pos.getY(i);\n                    const dist = Math.sqrt(x * x + y * y);\n                    \n                    const z = -15 / (dist * 0.4 + 1.5); \n                    pos.setZ(i, z);\n                }\n                geometry.computeVertexNormals();\n\n                const material = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({\n                    color: 0x8a3a8a, // Updated WebGL color to match purple brand\n                    transparent: true,\n                    opacity: 0.4,\n                    blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n                });\n                \n                const wireframeGeometry = new THREE.WireframeGeometry(geometry);\n                const mesh = new THREE.LineSegments(wireframeGeometry, material);\n                \n                mesh.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 2.1; \n                mesh.position.y = -2;\n                scene.add(mesh);\n\n                camera.position.z = 12;\n                camera.position.y = 1;\n\n                let time = 0;\n                const animate = () => {\n                    requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n                    time += 0.001;\n                    mesh.rotation.z = time;\n                    renderer.render(scene, camera);\n                };\n                animate();\n\n                window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                    if(!container) return;\n                    const width = container.clientWidth;\n                    const height = container.clientHeight;\n                    camera.aspect = width / height;\n                    camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                    renderer.setSize(width, height);\n                });\n            }\n\n            // GSAP Masked Staggered Word Reveal\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            const revealElements = document.querySelectorAll('.gsap-reveal');\n            \n            revealElements.forEach(el => {\n                const html = el.innerHTML;\n                const words = html.split(' ');\n                \n                el.innerHTML = words.map(word => {\n                    if(word.includes('<br>')) {\n                        return word.split('<br>').map(w => \n                            `<span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom pb-1 -mb-1\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[120%]\">${w}</span></span>`\n                        ).join('<br>');\n                    } else if (word.trim() !== '') {\n                        return `<span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom pb-1 -mb-1\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[120%]\">${word}</span></span>`;\n                    }\n                    return '';\n                }).join(' ');\n\n                gsap.to(el.querySelectorAll('.reveal-word'), {\n                    y: '0%',\n                    duration: 0.8,\n                    stagger: 0.04,\n                    ease: 'power3.out',\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: el,\n                        start: 'top 90%',\n                        toggleActions: 'play none none reverse'\n                    }\n                });\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "cognitive-data-synthesis.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/cognitive-data-synthesis.jpg", "source_name": "cognitive-data-synthesis-DESIGN.md", "views": 85, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-30T11:15:34.622125+00:00"}